    "text": "• The author is a Texan.\n• The author supported Talarico before Crockett entered the race.\n• The author appreciates Talarico's Christian faith and willingness to quote the Bible.\n• The author dislikes Christian Nationalism, which they believe contradicts Christ's teachings.\n• The author appreciates Talarico's focus on helping others and not attacking opponents.\n• The author is critical of politicians who blame the opposing party without offering constructive solutions.\n• The author believes bullying is immature and a threat to citizens.\n• The author questions the focus on undocumented workers compared to the actions of the wealthy and powerful.\n• The author would like to see Rep. Crockett run against Cruz in the next senatorial race.\n• The author is also considering who could replace Governor Abbott.",
